{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":66,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":66,"text":"becomes inner - the report shows 47000 of 50000, 600 per ten thousand lost.","end":"\n"}
